@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@token = replace-with-access-token

### List recorded entity types (AuditLog.Read)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auditLog/entityTypes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Filter by an exact entity type (AuditLog.Read)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auditLog?fromDate=2026-11-01&toDate=2026-11-13&entity=User&entityExact=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
